# 🔄 MikroTik Auto Backup to Gmail (Full Sensitive Included)
**RouterOS v7 Compliant (Tested on ROS v7.21.5)**  
*Developed by Dev'Hunter Security*

Skrip otomatisasi untuk melakukan backup seluruh konfigurasi MikroTik RouterOS ke email Gmail dalam format `.rsc` secara berkala. Skrip ini sudah disesuaikan untuk RouterOS v7 dengan mengekspor seluruh data sensitif (termasuk *password*, *PPPoE secret*, *IPSec keys*, dan *User credentials*).

---

## 📋 Persyaratan & Persiapan Gmail

Sebelum memasang skrip di MikroTik, Anda wajib menyiapkan akses **App Password** Gmail:

1. **Aktifkan Verifikasi 2 Langkah** pada akun Google Anda melalui:  
   `https://myaccount.google.com/security`
2. **Buat Kata Sandi Aplikasi (App Password):**  
   Buka `https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords`, buat App Password baru (misal dengan nama `MikroTik Backup`).
3. Simpan 16 karakter password yang diberikan oleh Google. Password ini yang akan digunakan pada konfigurasi SMTP MikroTik (BUKAN password login akun Gmail Anda).

---

## 🚀 Skrip Auto Backup MikroTik (RouterOS v7)

Salin kode di bawah ini, sesuaikan variabel parameter, lalu *paste* di **Terminal MikroTik**:

```routeros
###################################################################
# Backup Otomatis MikroTik ke Gmail (Includes Sensitive Passwords)
# Author  : Dev'Hunter Security
# Website : [https://devhuntersecurity.github.io](https://devhuntersecurity.github.io)
###################################################################

# 1. Konfigurasi SMTP Gmail
/tool e-mail
set server="smtp.gmail.com" \
    port=587 \
    tls=starttls \
    user="emailanda@gmail.com" \
    password="app_password_gmail_16_digit" \
    from="NamaRouter <emailanda@gmail.com>"

# 2. Hapus Scheduler Lama (Jika Ada)
/system scheduler
remove [find name=BACKUP-TO-EMAIL]

# 3. Buat Scheduler Backup Otomatis
/system scheduler
add name=BACKUP-TO-EMAIL \
    interval=1d \
    start-time=startup \
    policy=ftp,reboot,read,write,policy,test,password,sniff,sensitive,romon \
    comment="Backup Otomatis ke Gmail (Full Sensitive Passwords)" \
    on-event="#=========================================================
# Auto Backup MikroTik ke Gmail (With Passwords & Sensitive Data)
#=========================================================
:global date [/system clock get date]
:global d [:pick \$date 4 6]
:global m [:pick \$date 0 3]
:global y [:pick \$date 7 11]

:log warning \"-> Memulai Backup Router (Termasuk Passwords & Secrets)\"

:global backupfilersc ([/system identity get name] . \"-\" . \$m . \"-\" . \$d . \"-\" . \$y)

# Menggunakan show-sensitive agar password & secret ikut ter-export
/export show-sensitive file=\$backupfilersc

:delay 20s

:log warning \"-> Mengirim Backup ke Gmail\"

/tool e-mail send \
to=\"emailanda@gmail.com\" \
subject=([/system identity get name] . \" - Backup Konfigurasi (Sensitive Included)\") \
from=\"NamaRouter <emailanda@gmail.com>\" \
file=(\$backupfilersc . \".rsc\")

:delay 20s

:log warning \"-> Menghapus File Backup Lokal\"

/file remove (\$backupfilersc . \".rsc\")

:delay 5s

:log warning \"-> Backup Berhasil Dikirim ke Gmail\"
"
